{290}{Alright...where might I find her?}{}{5}{}{292}{}
{292}{She's just beyond the large door behind me.  But be warned...my mother is a magickal being of great power.  Her spirit swims in the flow, and sometimes she is more of that world than this one.  What she sees is not always what we see, so her answers might seem strange to you.  Ask what you wish to know, and LISTEN.  When you're through speaking with her, come and find me...}{She's just beyond the large door behind me.  But be warned...my mother is a magickal being of great power.  Her spirit swims in the flow, and sometimes she is more of that world than this one.  What she sees is not always what we see, so her answers might seem strange to you.  Ask what you wish to know, and LISTEN.  When you're through speaking with her, come and find me...}{}{45}{}{ru 2053}
