{326}{I'll take my leave of you, for now...}{}{5}{}{510}{}
{328}{Ravens and a storm?  And why did the storm subside, and then rage once again?  Nothing in my mother's visions is ever what it seems...we'll have to think on this. }{Ravens and a storm?  And why did the storm subside, and then rage once again?  Nothing in my mother's visions is ever what it seems...we'll have to think on this. }{}{52}{}{}
