{332}{I'll take my leave of you, for now...}{}{5}{qa1046 2}{510}{}
{334}{As you told her, this must have been the man you know as Gilbert Bates.  She saw him because he plays such a large role in their fate...}{As you told her, this must have been the man you know as Gilbert Bates.  She saw him because he plays such a large role in their fate...}{}{53}{}{}
