{337}{I'll take my leave of you, for now...}{}{5}{qb1046 1}{506}{}
{338}{I'll take my leave of you, for now...}{}{5}{qa1046 2}{510}{}
{340}{I'm not sure what that represents, but I know that fire, in her visions, often represents magick.  And the water, you say, quenched it?  Or did the flame burn itself out...?}{I'm not sure what that represents, but I know that fire, in her visions, often represents magick.  And the water, you say, quenched it?  Or did the flame burn itself out...?}{}{54}{}{}
{341}{There were other visions of the Black Mountain Clan...}{}{5}{}{308}{}
{342}{She also had visions of M'in Gorad...}{}{5}{}{315}{}
{343}{I'll take my leave of you, for now...}{}{5}{qb1046 1}{506}{}
{344}{I'll take my leave of you, for now...}{}{5}{qa1046 2}{510}{}
{346}{These are two separate visions.  The flame, again, represents magick...but twisted somehow, burning darkly.  And did you say that the Black Mountain Clan was near this flame?  The mirrored plain, a white sky, a lone figure.  The worlds on either side of that mirror are the same...who could say which one is real?  Odd. [she looks at you strangely...]}{These are two separate visions.  The flame, again, represents magick...but twisted somehow, burning darkly.  And did you say that the Black Mountain Clan was near this flame?  The mirrored plain, a white sky, a lone figure.  The worlds on either side of that mirror are the same...who could say which one is real?  Odd. [she looks at you strangely...]}{}{55}{}{}
{347}{There were other visions of the Black Mountain Clan...}{}{5}{}{308}{}
{348}{She also had visions of M'in Gorad...}{}{5}{}{315}{}
{349}{I'll take my leave of you, for now...}{}{5}{qb1046 1}{506}{}
{350}{I'll take my leave of you, for now...}{}{5}{qa1046 2}{510}{}
{352}{What the screaming man and his key represent, I have no idea...but I do know that the official symbol for the city of Caladon is a wolf, with one paw raised in the air...}{What the screaming man and his key represent, I have no idea...but I do know that the official symbol for the city of Caladon is a wolf, with one paw raised in the air...}{}{56}{}{}
{353}{Perhaps we need begin our search there, Raven...}{}{5}{}{355}{}
{355}{I'm not so sure.  Remember, my mother's visions are shackled by neither our eyes nor our time...the events she describes might be in either the future or the past...let's look at all she's said before we go any further...}{I'm not so sure.  Remember, my mother's visions are shackled by neither our eyes nor our time...the events she describes might be in either the future or the past...let's look at all she's said before we go any further...}{}{57}{}{}
{356}{There were other visions of the M'in Gorad...}{}{5}{}{315}{}
{357}{She also had visions of The Black Mountain Clan...}{}{5}{}{308}{}
{358}{I'll take my leave of you, for now...}{}{5}{qb1046 1}{506}{}
{359}{I'll take my leave of you, for now...}{}{5}{qa1046 2}{510}{}
{361}{There's something about that entire vision which pulls at my memory...especially the ring.  I'll think about it further...}{There's something about that entire vision which pulls at my memory...especially the ring.  I'll think about it further...}{}{58}{}{}
{362}{There were other visions of the M'in Gorad...}{}{5}{}{315}{}
{363}{She also had visions of The Black Mountain Clan...}{}{5}{}{308}{}
{364}{I'll take my leave of you, for now...}{}{5}{qb1046 1}{506}{}
{365}{I'll take my leave of you, for now...}{}{5}{qa1046 2}{510}{}
{367}{I've no idea...}{I've no idea...}{}{59}{}{}
{368}{Wait!  That sounds like the symbol on an amulet I've seen...}{}{5}{gf1045 1}{374}{}
{369}{There were other visions of the M'in Gorad...}{}{5}{}{315}{}
{370}{She also had visions of The Black Mountain Clan...}{}{5}{}{308}{}
{371}{I'll take my leave of you, for now...}{}{5}{qb1046 1}{506}{}
{372}{I'll take my leave of you, for now...}{}{5}{qa1046 2}{510}{}
{374}{Interesting.  That's the ancient symbol of the Molochean Hand.  Do you know of it?}{Interesting.  That's the ancient symbol of the Molochean Hand.  Do you know of it?}{}{60}{}{}
{375}{Let's stick to the business at hand...what does the vision mean?}{}{5}{}{393}{}
{376}{Yes...I know they were an ancient order of assassins...}{}{5}{gf1085 1}{379}{}
{377}{No...could you tell me of them?}{}{5}{gf1085 0}{379}{}
{379}{The Molochean Hand were assassins for what used to be known as the Derian-Ka...the ancient Order of the Dead...}{The Molochean Hand were assassins for what used to be known as the Derian-Ka...the ancient Order of the Dead...}{}{61}{}{gf1085 1}
{380}{The Order of the Dead?  Who were they?}{}{5}{gf1087 0}{384}{}
{381}{Magnus Shale Fist mentioned something of them...}{}{5}{gf1087 1}{384}{}
{382}{Interesting...but I'd rather just know what the vision meant...}{}{5}{}{393}{}
{384}{The Derian-Ka were a shadowy group who formed during the Age of Legends.  Their membership, and their agenda, were always very secret.  I know little about them, beyond the most cursory knowledge, but there have always been rumors about who they were, and what they were doing...}{The Derian-Ka were a shadowy group who formed during the Age of Legends.  Their membership, and their agenda, were always very secret.  I know little about them, beyond the most cursory knowledge, but there have always been rumors about who they were, and what they were doing...}{}{62}{}{}
{385}{And their connection to the Molochean Hand?}{}{5}{}{387}{}
{387}{As I said, the Molochean Hand were their assassins.  From what I remember of what is written about them, the Hand was ejected from the Order of the Dead on grounds of doctrinal differences...there was a small struggle, and then the Hand disappeared.  There are always rumors of its re-emergence, but, from what I know, that's all they are...rumors...}{As I said, the Molochean Hand were their assassins.  From what I remember of what is written about them, the Hand was ejected from the Order of the Dead on grounds of doctrinal differences...there was a small struggle, and then the Hand disappeared.  There are always rumors of its re-emergence, but, from what I know, that's all they are...rumors...}{}{63}{}{}
{388}{These amulets and the attempts on my life might say different...}{}{5}{}{390}{}
{390}{I agree...but I don't know why they would be involved in this business.  Very interesting...}{I agree...but I don't know why they would be involved in this business.  Very interesting...}{}{64}{}{}
{391}{What do you think the vision itself means?}{}{5}{}{393}{}
{393}{I don't really know, although it would seem that perhaps they are being mislead...blindness in my mother's visions is sometimes associated with deception.  As far as the man in the mask who is draped in truth?  I have no idea...}{I don't really know, although it would seem that perhaps they are being mislead...blindness in my mother's visions is sometimes associated with deception.  As far as the man in the mask who is draped in truth?  I have no idea...}{}{65}{}{}
{394}{There were other visions of the M'in Gorad...}{}{5}{}{315}{}
{395}{She also had visions of The Black Mountain Clan...}{}{5}{}{308}{}
{396}{I'll take my leave of you, for now...}{}{5}{qb1046 1}{506}{}
{397}{I'll take my leave of you, for now...}{}{5}{qa1046 2}{510}{}
{399}{This one is most interesting of all.  And it seems that my fears may have well been correct...}{This one is most interesting of all.  And it seems that my fears may have well been correct...}{}{66}{}{}
{400}{Why, Raven?  What do you think it means?}{}{5}{}{402}{}
{402}{Do you remember when I told you that the name of M'in Gorad bothered me in some way?  Well, I believe that may have been so because M'in Gorad is a DARK name...}{Do you remember when I told you that the name of M'in Gorad bothered me in some way?  Well, I believe that may have been so because M'in Gorad is a DARK name...}{}{67}{}{}
{403}{What does that mean, a dark name?}{}{5}{}{405}{}
{405}{A Dark Elf name.  Do you know of the Dark Elves?}{A Dark Elf name.  Do you know of the Dark Elves?}{}{68}{}{ru 2054}
{406}{I've heard very little of them...could you elaborate?}{}{5}{}{409}{}
{407}{I don't really care to know.  I'd just like to find M'in Gorad...}{}{5}{}{433}{}
{409}{It's a long story, but sometime during the Age of Legends, many years before even my mother was born, there were a group of elves who separated themselves...there were philosophical differences, and they were no longer welcome in our forests...those elves became what we know as the Dark Elves...}{It's a long story, but sometime during the Age of Legends, many years before even my mother was born, there were a group of elves who separated themselves...there were philosophical differences, and they were no longer welcome in our forests...those elves became what we know as the Dark Elves...}{}{69}{}{}
{410}{What were the differences?}{}{5}{}{418}{}
{411}{What is the 'Age of Legends'?}{}{5}{}{413}{}
{413}{The Age of Legends refers to a time in Arcanum's history when things were much different than they are now.  There was an elven council that ruled over all of the races, and magick was a LARGE part of everyone's lives.  It was the time of heroes and great good, and also of great evil.  A time before the rise of technology, before the dwarven Clan Wars, before the mages left for Tulla...}{The Age of Legends refers to a time in Arcanum's history when things were much different than they are now.  There was an elven council that ruled over all of the races, and magick was a LARGE part of everyone's lives.  It was the time of heroes and great good, and also of great evil.  A time before the rise of technology, before the dwarven Clan Wars, before the mages left for Tulla...}{}{70}{}{}
{414}{I see...and the differences between you and the Dark Elves?}{}{5}{gf1098 0}{418}{}
{415}{What more is there to the story of Arronax...?}{}{5}{gf1098 1}{688}{}
{416}{The Void?  What is the Void?}{}{5}{gf1098 1}{681}{}
{418}{They believe that this world, and ALL of its races, are subject to elven rule.  They believe that elves are superior because of our close connection to nature, our power in the ways of magic, the longevity of our physical form.  They see the other races as bumbling children who need our guidance, regardless of its severity...}{They believe that this world, and ALL of its races, are subject to elven rule.  They believe that elves are superior because of our close connection to nature, our power in the ways of magic, the longevity of our physical form.  They see the other races as bumbling children who need our guidance, regardless of its severity...}{}{71}{}{}
{419}{And what of the elves of Qintarra?  What do they believe?}{}{5}{}{422}{}
{420}{And you?  What do YOU believe?}{}{5}{}{429}{}
{422}{The elves of Qintarra...in fact ALL other elves...believe that everything and every one has a rightful place in the experience which forms this reality.  Elves feel that very little, if anything, ever happens that isn't a part of the natural progression of that state.  They feel no superiority because of their...advantages...that is just the role they have been picked to play...}{The elves of Qintarra...in fact ALL other elves...believe that everything and every one has a rightful place in the experience which forms this reality.  Elves feel that very little, if anything, ever happens that isn't a part of the natural progression of that state.  They feel no superiority because of their...advantages...that is just the role they have been picked to play...}{}{72}{}{}
{423}{Do they see the Dark Elves as a violation of that order...?}{}{5}{}{425}{}
{425}{Unfortunately not.  The Dark Elves are seen in the same light as everyone else...they have their role and they are playing it...}{Unfortunately not.  The Dark Elves are seen in the same light as everyone else...they have their role and they are playing it...}{}{73}{}{}
{426}{I see.  Let's get back to your mother's vision.}{}{5}{}{433}{}
{427}{You say 'unfortunately'.  What do you believe, Raven?}{}{5}{}{429}{}
{429}{[Her features harden]  I believe...well, let us say that I don't always see eye to eye with those in Qintarra concerning the 'rightful' place of the Dark Elves.  MY role here is as protector.  I will do so, regardless of the cost.}{[Her features harden]  I believe...well, let us say that I don't always see eye to eye with those in Qintarra concerning the 'rightful' place of the Dark Elves.  MY role here is as protector.  I will do so, regardless of the cost.}{}{74}{}{}
{430}{I see.  Let's get back to your mother's vision.}{}{5}{}{433}{}
{431}{What DO the elves here believe?}{}{5}{}{422}{}
{433}{My mother's vision of the lost children was referring, I believe, to the Dark Elves.  They were hidden from her because they are hidden from ALL of us...through magick and isolation, we've not seen where they live for almost 500 years...}{My mother's vision of the lost children was referring, I believe, to the Dark Elves.  They were hidden from her because they are hidden from ALL of us...through magick and isolation, we've not seen where they live for almost 500 years...}{}{75}{}{}
{434}{But who was the man running from them?}{}{5}{}{436}{}
{436}{There was a man...many years ago...who had come to the Glimmering Forest to study the elves, and I remember that he was very interested in the Dark Elves especially.  There were rumors about his capture by them, and an escape...}{There was a man...many years ago...who had come to the Glimmering Forest to study the elves, and I remember that he was very interested in the Dark Elves especially.  There were rumors about his capture by them, and an escape...}{}{76}{}{}
{437}{Who was he?}{}{5}{}{439}{}
{439}{As I said, he was a researcher...a strange little man, a bit overdressed, but kind-hearted and very intelligent...I was young then, a mere 160 years old...he was the first human I'd ever seen...[She smiles, slightly.]}{As I said, he was a researcher...a strange little man, a bit overdressed, but kind-hearted and very intelligent...I was young then, a mere 160 years old...he was the first human I'd ever seen...[She smiles, slightly.]}{}{77}{}{}
{440}{Do you remember his name?}{}{5}{}{445}{lf8 1}
{445}{His name...it was long ago...but I remember, because he said it so often...I think humans just like hearing the sound of their own names.  [She laughs, lightly.]   Terwilliger...Dr. Renford A. Terwilliger...I can hear him saying it even now...[She laughs again...]}{His name...it was long ago...but I remember, because he said it so often...I think humans just like hearing the sound of their own names.  [She laughs, lightly.]   Terwilliger...Dr. Renford A. Terwilliger...I can hear him saying it even now...[She laughs again...]}{}{78}{}{gf1086 1, ss 10, ru 2055}
{446}{What were the 'leaves' he was dropping?}{}{5}{lf9 0}{451}{lf9 1}
{447}{What is the 'place of smoke and water'?}{}{5}{lf10 0}{468}{lf10 1}
{448}{Well, what now?}{}{5}{lf81 , lf9 1, lf10 1, qb1046 1}{474}{}
{451}{I don't know.  It almost seemed, in the vision, that the 'flock' who consumed him were more interested in the leaves...and my mother even said to find what was left behind...these 'leaves' might very well be what we are looking for...}{I don't know.  It almost seemed, in the vision, that the 'flock' who consumed him were more interested in the leaves...and my mother even said to find what was left behind...these 'leaves' might very well be what we are looking for...}{}{79}{}{}
{452}{I've made an interesting connection between the visions...}{}{16}{}{457}{}
{454}{What is the 'place of smoke and water'?}{}{5}{lf10 0}{468}{lf10 1}
{455}{Well, what now?}{}{5}{lf81 , lf9 1, lf10 1, qb1046 1}{474}{}
{457}{What is it you've seen?}{What is it you've seen?}{}{80}{}{}
{458}{In many of the visions, there were flocks of birds...}{}{5}{}{460}{}
{460}{Yes?}{Yes?}{}{81}{}{}
{461}{I think that they always represent the Dark Elves...}{}{5}{}{463}{}
{463}{Interesting...it does paint an interesting picture, and it might change the way we think about some of them...the ravens circling the storm, the man who'd had his eyes plucked out by the birds, and now this man dropping leaves...interesting...}{Interesting...it does paint an interesting picture, and it might change the way we think about some of them...the ravens circling the storm, the man who'd had his eyes plucked out by the birds, and now this man dropping leaves...interesting...}{}{82}{}{}
{465}{What is the 'place of smoke and water'?}{}{5}{lf10 0}{468}{lf10 1}
{466}{Well, what now?}{}{5}{lf81 , lf9 1, lf10 1, qb1046 1}{474}{}
{468}{She could mean almost anywhere, but if I were to make a guess, I'd say she was talking about the human city of Tarant.  It lies in the Gulf of Morbihan, and its...what do you call them, factories?...are always belching smoke into the skies.  That, and...[she winks, and smiles slyly] I know that Terwilliger was from there...}{She could mean almost anywhere, but if I were to make a guess, I'd say she was talking about the human city of Tarant.  It lies in the Gulf of Morbihan, and its...what do you call them, factories?...are always belching smoke into the skies.  That, and...[she winks, and smiles slyly] I know that Terwilliger was from there...}{}{83}{}{}
{470}{What were the 'leaves' he was dropping?}{}{5}{lf9 0}{451}{lf9 1}
{471}{Well, what now?}{}{5}{lf81 , lf9 1, lf10 1, qb1046 1}{474}{}
{474}{You have a place to begin your search, my friend.  It would seem that if you need to find this M'in Gorad, you're going to need to find the village of Dark Elves.  The only person who may know where they are is Renford A. Terwilliger.  He may or may not be in Tarant, but it's a good place to start looking...}{You have a place to begin your search, my friend.  It would seem that if you need to find this M'in Gorad, you're going to need to find the village of Dark Elves.  The only person who may know where they are is Renford A. Terwilliger.  He may or may not be in Tarant, but it's a good place to start looking...}{}{84}{}{qu1020 1, qu1021 1}
{475}{Then I will the find the Dark Elves.  To Tarant I shall go...}{}{5}{}{476}{qu1020 2, qu1021 2}
{476}{You impress me, my friend. [She takes your hand.]  Few are those, like you, who would take this burden upon themselves.  You've earned my respect....}{You impress me, my friend. Few are those, like you, who would take this burden upon themselves.  You've earned my respect....}{}{85}{}{}
{477}{I'm no hero...I just want people to stop trying to kill me...}{}{5}{}{487}{}
{478}{Your respect makes it all the more worth it...}{0}{5}{}{490}{}
{479}{Your respect makes it all the more worth it...}{1}{5}{}{-31}{}
{486}{Whatever.  Would you mind letting go of my hand so I can go?}{}{5}{}{501}{}
{487}{[Her hand slips from yours.] Perhaps I misjudged, you...but no matter.  Your actions, however they are motivated, are noble.  Good luck.  Return to me when you've found the dark elves, and tell me what you've uncovered...}{Perhaps I misjudged, you...but no matter.  Your actions, however they are motivated, are noble.  Good luck.  Return to me when you've found the dark elves, and tell me what you've uncovered...}{}{86}{}{qu1046 1}
{488}{I'll return when I know more...good bye...}{}{5}{}{0}{qu1046 2}
{490}{[She locks eyes with you.]  There are strong bonds between women such as we.  Good luck.  Return to me when you've found the dark elves, and tell me what you've uncovered...}{[She locks eyes with you.]  There are strong bonds between women such as we.  Good luck.  Return to me when you've found the dark elves, and tell me what you've uncovered...}{}{87}{}{qu1046 1}
{491}{I'll return when I know more...good bye...}{}{5}{}{0}{qu1046 2}
{493}{[She smiles.]  Thank you for the compliment.  It looks like we're going to be good friends, @PCNAME@.    Return to me, when you've found the Dark Elves, and tell me what you uncover.  We'll have much to discuss when you return...}{[She smiles.]  Thank you for the compliment.  It looks like we're going to be good friends, @PCNAME@.    Return to me, when you've found the Dark Elves, and tell me what you uncover.  We'll have much to discuss when you return...}{}{88}{}{qu1046 1}
{494}{I'll return when I know more...good bye...}{}{5}{}{0}{qu1046 2}
{498}{[Raven blushes, then steps closer, speaking softly.]  Return to me, when you've found the Dark Elves, and tell me what you uncover.  [Almost a whisper.]  We will have much to discuss...}{[Raven blushes, then steps closer, speaking softly.]  Return to me, when you've found the Dark Elves, and tell me what you uncover.  [Almost a whisper.]  We will have much to discuss...}{}{89}{}{qu1046 1, lf12 1, gf2364 1}
{499}{I'll return when I know more, Raven...good bye, for now...}{}{5}{}{0}{qu1046 2}
{501}{[Stiffly, releasing your hand.] Y-y-es, of course.  Forgive me.  I'll detain you no longer.  Return to me when you've found the dark elves, and tell me what you've uncovered...}{[Stiffly.] Y-y-es, of course.  Forgive me.  I'll detain you no longer.  Return to me when you've found the dark elves, and tell me what you've uncovered...}{}{90}{}{qu1046 1}
{502}{I'll return when I have more information about this...}{}{5}{}{}{qu1046 2}
{506}{Alright...but return soon!  We need to talk further about these visions.  I don't believe we've found yet what we're looking for...}{Alright...but return soon!  We need to talk further about these visions.  I don't believe we've found yet what we're looking for...}{}{91}{}{}
{507}{Of course...but I do have a few more general questions...}{}{5}{}{101}{}
{508}{I will, Raven...}{}{5}{}{0}{}
{510}{Okay.  But return anytime you'd like to speak about them.  Was there anything else?}{Okay.  But return anytime you'd like to speak about them.  Was there anything else?}{}{92}{}{}
{511}{I do have a few more general questions...}{}{5}{}{101}{}
{512}{E:}{}{5}{}{0}{}
{516}{I'm so very glad you've returned to us.  Did you find the village of the Dark Elves? What has happened since you left us?}{I'm so very glad you've returned to us.  Did you find the village of the Dark Elves? What has happened since you left us?}{}{93}{}{qu1046 4}
{517}{I traveled to Tarant, and...[Tell her how you found T'sen-Ang.]}{}{5}{}{552}{}
{522}{I'm so glad you've returned safely, @PCNAME@, so very relieved...[She clasps both of your hands, her eyes looking over you.]  Are you hurt?  Perhaps you need some healing...?}{I'm so glad you've returned safely, @PCNAME@, so very relieved...[She clasps both of your hands, her eyes looking over you.]  Are you hurt?  Perhaps you need some healing...?}{}{94}{}{qu1046 4}
{523}{No, Raven.  I'm fine.  But it is good to see you...}{}{5}{}{527}{re +5}
{524}{Your offer is generous, Raven.  I would very much like that...}{}{5}{}{530}{re +5}
{525}{We have urgent business to attend to...I bring news...}{}{5}{}{539}{lf12 0, re -5, gf2364 0}
{527}{Very well, perhaps another time.  [She  smiles slowly, her eyes lingering longer than they have to.]  What news do you bring of M'in Gorad?  Did you find him?}{Very well, perhaps another time.  [She  smiles slowly, her eyes lingering longer than they have to.]  What news do you bring of M'in Gorad?  Did you find him?}{}{95}{}{}
{528}{I bring news of the Dark Elves...}{}{5}{}{542}{}
{530}{Then I shall heal you...[She steps closer, sliding her hands to your shoulders and touching her forehead to your chest.  She breathes slowly and deeply...her hands grip you more tightly as she pulls you closer.  A heat begins to grow between you--there's a slight buzzing in your ears.  She whispers...]  Are you ready?}{Then I shall heal you...[she steps closer, sliding her hands to your shoulders and touching her forehead to your chest.  She breathes slowly and deeply...her hands grip you more tightly as she pulls you closer.  A heat begins to grow between you--there's a slight buzzing in your ears.  She whispers...]  Are you ready?}{}{96}{}{}
{531}{Yes...}{}{5}{}{-49}{}
{536}{There...[she steps back, smiling, her hands lingering on your shoulders before they fall again to her sides.]  You say you have news?}{There...[she steps back, smiling, her hands lingering on your shoulders before they fall again to her sides.]  You say you have news?}{}{98}{}{}
{537}{I bring news of the Dark Elves...}{}{5}{}{542}{}
{539}{[Stiffly.] Y-y-es, of course. [Her hands fall away quickly as she takes a step back.]  What did you find out?}{[Stiffly.] Y-y-es, of course. [Her hands fall away quickly as she takes a step back.]  What did you find out?}{}{99}{}{}
{540}{I bring news of the Dark Elves...}{}{5}{}{542}{}
{542}{Did you find the village of the Dark Elves?  Tell me what happened...}{Did you find the village of the Dark Elves?  Tell me what happened...}{}{100}{}{}
{543}{I traveled to Tarant, and...[Tell her how you found T'sen-Ang.]}{}{5}{}{545}{}
{545}{That's quite an adventure...but it seems you found what you were looking for.  And this M'in Gorad?  Did you find him?  Did he tell you what happened to the Black Mountain Clan?}{That's quite an adventure...but it seems you found what you were looking for.  And this M'in Gorad?  Did you find him?  Did he tell you what happened to the Black Mountain Clan?}{}{101}{}{lc4 1}
{546}{Yes, SHE was in the village.  I spoke with her...}{}{5}{lf12 1, gf2001 1}{568}{}
{547}{Yes, SHE was in the village.  I spoke with her...}{}{5}{lf12  0, gf2001 1}{552}{}
{548}{Yes, SHE was in the village...}{}{5}{gf2001 0, lf12 0}{552}{}
