{695}{Vendigroth?  I know that the Vendigroth Wastes are to the north, and that Vendigroth plays a part in the Panarii legends of Arronax.  There's been debate as to whether it was an actual city, or merely something symbolic.  It would seem that the Dark Elves, and this K'an Hua, might have found something there...}{Vendigroth?  I know that the Vendigroth Wastes are to the north, and that Vendigroth plays a part in the Panarii legends of Arronax.  There's been debate as to whether it was an actual city, or merely something symbolic.  It would seem that the Dark Elves, and this K'an Hua, might have found something there...}{}{131}{}{}
