{1183}{[Raven looks at Z'an Al'urin, her eyes narrowing.]  I go nowhere with the Dark Elf woman.  If she's with you, then I am not....it's as simple as that...}{[Raven looks at Z'an Al'urin, her eyes narrowing.]  I go nowhere with the Dark Elf woman.  If she's with you, then I am not....it's as simple as that...}{}{217}{}{}
